                                                                  6431 1451
 RESONANCE REGION (MF 2)                                        &&6431 1451
 Author:  S.F. Mughabghab March, 2006 (BNL)                     &&6431 1451
                                                                  6431 1451
 The parameters for resonances in MF 2 (resolved and unresolved   6431 1451
  region) are based on the analyzis presented in Ref.1. The       6431 1451
  resolved region is first analyzed in multi-level Breit-Wigner   6431 1451
  by S. Mughabghab and then converted into Reich-Moore            6431 1451
  formalism by L. Leal.                                           6431 1451
                                                                  6431 1451
 - Resolved Resonances               <2.7 keV        : Ref.1    &&6431 1451
 - Unresolved Resonances            2.7 keV - 123 keV: Ref.1    &&6431 1451
                                                                &&6431 1451
