 COVARIANCE FILE: cross sections (MF 33)                          6431 1451
 Author:  T. Kawano, D. Rochman, M. W. Herman and P. Oblozinsky   6431 1451
                                                                  6431 1451
 The covariance matrixes have been determined using the EMPIRE    6431 1451
 and KALMAN codes [Ka01,Sh01,Ka02] for the unresolved and         6431 1451
 fast neutron regions. Cross section sensitivity to model         6431 1451
 parameters were calculated with EMPIRE down to the lower boundary6431 1451
 of the unresolved region. Then the KALMAN code was used to       6431 1451
 to calculate uncertainties and correlations. Results were        6431 1451
 formated in MF=33. The file has been tested with NJOY and ERRORJ.6431 1451
                                                                  6431 1451
 The file has been tested with NJOY and ERRORJ.                   6431 1451
